1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
There was once a humble bricklayer named Marco.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Every day, he laid brick after brick under the hot sun,

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
earning just enough to feed his family.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,000
His job seemed small, and many around him

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,000
saw it as unimportant.

6
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,000
But Marco believed in one thing.

7
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Do your best, no matter how small the task.

8
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,000
One day, while working on a large construction site,

9
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:27,000
an architect walked by and asked him, what are you doing?

10
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Marco wiped his brow and replied, I'm building a cathedral.

11
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:34,000
The architect was surprised.

12
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:36,000
You're just laying bricks.

13
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Marco smiled.

14
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Yes, but every brick I lay, I do with care and purpose.

15
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Because one day, these bricks will become a place

16
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,000
where people find peace, hope, and meaning.

17
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:49,000
That's not just a job.

18
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:50,000
That's a legacy.

19
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Years passed.

20
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:56,000
The cathedral was completed, grand and awe-inspiring.

21
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:59,000
Visitors came from all over the world to admire it.

22
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:03,000
And on a plaque near the entrance, among the names of designers

23
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:07,000
and donors, someone had carved, dedicated to Marco,

24
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:11,000
the man who believed that every small action has great purpose.

